  "derivation": "Two-triangle UV-bounds leaf cards fitted to the source leaf vertices; original sampling strides 1/8/48, with area compensation. Existing non-leaf geometry and images retained. Original near-tier bounds retain tree normalization. Runtime supplies the shared unmodified alpha map and bakes middle/distant leaf clusters into shared color, normal and roughness atlases once per jungle load. Ordinary foliage and depth materials sample those atlases each frame."
